,null,{"children":"Fifteen minutes. I learn what you\u2019re making, who it\u2019s for, and what\u2019s currently in the way."}]]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"step","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"step-number","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"step-text","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Brief & scope"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"You get it in writing: deliverables, lengths, revision rounds, dates, price. Nothing starts until you approve it."}]]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"step","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"step-number","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"step-text","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Edit & review"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"First cuts arrive on the agreed date. You review and I revise, within the rounds your package includes."}]]}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"step","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"step-number","children":"04"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"step-text","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Deliver & post"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Final files land organised and platform-ready. Shorts sized per platform, captions burned in, thumbnails attached."}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"pricing-notes","id":"faq","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"pricing-notes-heading","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"pricing-kicker","children":"06 / QUESTIONS"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before we hit play."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pricing-faq","children":[["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"What footage do you need from me?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Whatever you have: phone, camera, screen recordings. Send the highest quality version you have, unedited, via Google Drive, WeTransfer or a shared folder. I\u2019ll tell you on the call if there\u2019s a gap, before you pay anything."}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"What if I have no footage at all?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Then Starter and Growth aren\u2019t for you yet. Studio is. I come and film it. If a full production is more than you need right now, book the call anyway and I\u2019ll map out the cheapest way to get usable footage, even if that\u2019s you and a phone on a tripod."}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"How do I pay?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Starter:"}]," Full payment immediately. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Growth:"}]," billed monthly, on the same date each month. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Studio:"}]," 70% before the shoot, 30% on final delivery. Bank transfer and card both work. Invoices and receipts for organisations and agencies, and I can work with your procurement process."]}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"How many revisions do I get?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Starter 2 rounds per video, Growth 3, Studio 3 on the hero film and 2 per cutdown. A round is one consolidated set of notes. If the first cut misses the approved brief, I recut it free and that round doesn\u2019t count against your total."}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"What if I don\u2019t need long-form video?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Then we swap it out. Each long-form edit trades for 2 extra shorts, so Growth becomes 14 short-form edits a month at the same price. In place of the long-form subtitles, you get 4 cover frames for your feed grid and extra-language captions burned into 4 of the shorts. The trade only runs one way \u2014 long-form into shorts, not shorts into long-form \u2014 because a long-form edit takes several times the work of a short. One condition: shorts are cut from the same batch of footage. If you need 14 shorts from 14 unrelated sources, each one needs its own brief and review, so I\u2019ll quote that separately."}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"Who owns the final files?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Client reserves the right to all agreed upon deliverables."}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"Is there a minimum commitment?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Growth and Studio run in 3-month seasons, because content compounds: your audience and the algorithm need about 90 days of consistent posting before the results show. You\u2019re billed monthly and nothing renews automatically. At the end of the season you choose whether to continue. If month one misses the brief we agreed in writing, you can end the season there and owe nothing more. Starter is always one-time, with no commitment at all."}]]}],["$","details",null,{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"Do you work outside Lagos and Abuja?"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Yes, anywhere in Nigeria. For Studio shoots, travel, accommodation and permits are quoted separately and approved by you before anything is booked."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"pricing-section final-cta","id":"start","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Let\u2019s work out what you actually need."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"final-cta-lead","children":"Fifteen minutes, no pitch. Tell me what you\u2019re making and I\u2019ll tell you which package fits, or if none of them do."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pricing-actions final-cta-actions","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://calendar.app.google/4Z1x1rKG1f6mJqTu9","className":"pricing-cta","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Book a free 15-min call"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"\u2197"}]]}],["$","a",null,{"href":"/checkout","className":"pricing-cta pricing-cta-secondary","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Start with Starter \u00b7 \u20a6450,000"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"\u2197"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","footer",null,{"className":"pricing-footer","children":[["$","span",null,